# You're in the Carousel Room. You have to get to the
# Riddle Room from here, and chances are very good it
# won't happen on the first try. The room is actually
# to the southeast, but that direction, like any other,
# only has a 1-in-8 chance of actually working. This
# seed makes the below work.

sw. sw. se
say "a well"

# Needed because with this seed, the Wizard appears
# and causes you to drop your teapot.
take teapot

e. e
enter bucket
pour water in bucket
get out
e

# Walkthroughs say "get all except orange" here, but under this
# release the load limit refuses the third cake while the teapot is
# in hand -- and it is no Wizard spell: waiting does not help. The
# teapot is the bulk. Park it on the table, take the cakes, and
# collect it again after growing back.

put teapot on table
get green. get red. get blue
eat green
e
throw red in pool
get candy
w
eat blue
nw

robot, go e
e
robot, push triangular
robot, go s
s
get sphere
robot, lift cage
get sphere

n. w

# In stopping the Carousel Room, you've gotten this room spinning.
# The idea is just to keep returning here and trying southeeast
# until you get to the Tea Room. This seed will work with the
# below.

se. w. se

# The teapot was never lost: the spun-room escape lands back in the
# Tea Room, right where it was parked on the table. Take it, walk
# west to the well top, and ride down the way you came up -- the
# bucket rises when water is poured in, and descends when the water
# is scooped back out, INTO the teapot, which is the teapot's whole
# job. (The Wizard drops by mid-descent under this seed, waves his
# wand, and mercifully changes his mind.)

